    **Changes made:** [make this a numbered list]

    * **[original]** ‚Üí **[correction, on a new line]** ‚Äî [brief reason, on a new line]
    * **[original]** ‚Üí **[correction, on a new line]** ‚Äî [brief reason, on a new line]

    **No changes needed:** [List any that looked like errors but are actually fine]

